      <title>本田中国否认大幅降价指令 1.5万亿日元成本目标指向供应链压力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E5%A4%A7%E5%B9%85%E9%99%8D%E4%BB%B7%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4-1.5%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E6%97%A5%E5%85%83%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</link>
